# Event$ Moved | ReplacementResult$ Updated | ReplaceWith$ LoseLife: "As Lich
# enters, you lose life equal to your life total." The line runs before the
# move and the entry then goes on (ReplacementHandler.run's Updated branch), so
# Lich enters and its own GameLoss replacement keeps the 0-life player in the
# game at the state-based check.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
tapformana human 5 B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
